# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# The wheel scrolls the page.  A program opened at its end stands with
# its thumb at the bottom; rolling the wheel up over the page walks the
# view -- and the thumb with it -- toward the top, the caret staying
# where it was left.  This is the runner's lane: TikuBasic is hosted
# through tiku-run, so the wheel here has crossed the wire to reach it.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Development
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
click-window Project
wait 8
key Down
wait 8
key Return
wait 90
expect-title main.bas
note the page opened at its end: the thumb is at the bottom, the track
note above it empty
expect-pixel 803 350 c2c2c2
expect-pixel 803 500 7d7d7d
note the wheel rolled up over the page walks the view to the top, and
note the thumb comes with it
press 400 400 4
wait 6
press 400 400 4
wait 6
press 400 400 4
wait 6
press 400 400 4
wait 6
press 400 400 4
wait 6
press 400 400 4
wait 6
press 400 400 4
wait 20
expect-pixel 803 350 7d7d7d
expect-pixel 803 500 c2c2c2
quit
